OL,3,GNEWSAHuman trafficking is not just
OL,4,Asomething you see in a film, says
OL,5,Asurvivor
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who was trafficked has said
OL,8,Fpeople need to remember that the crime
OL,9,Fis not just "something you see in a
OL,10,Ffilm" but a reality for victims.
OL,12,FRebecca Whyte said she felt "very
OL,13,Fblessed" that she was no longer a
OL,14,Fvictim of the trafficking industry.
OL,16,FShe was speaking following an
OL,17,Finvestigation into "pimping websites"
OL,18,Fwhich found that human trafficking is a
OL,19,F"catastrophic" problem that is being
OL,20,F"hidden in plain sight online".
